error[E0277]: `Cons<Pos, Cons<Heat, notko_hlist::Empty>>` has no product through `Read`
  --> tests/compile_fail/a_carrier_with_no_form_for_a_member_has_no_product.rs:18:14
   |
18 |     let _p: <Cons<Pos, Cons<Heat, Empty>> as Project<Read>>::Prod = PCons {
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the trait `Project<Read>` is not implemented for `Cons<Pos, Cons<Heat, notko_hlist::Empty>>`
   |
   = note: A product is defined for lists built from `Empty` and `Cons<H, T>` where the carrier holds a form for every member, through `Carrier<H>`, so the usual cause is a member the carrier has no form for, or a tail that is not a list.
